				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">expeditior et celerior remuneratio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Off. 2, 20, 69</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">benevolentiae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Lael. 14, 49</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">officiorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Inv. 2, 22, 66</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">RAT. S. R., i. e. rationalis sacrarum
					remunerationum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 1090</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">SANCTARVM REMVNERATIONVM PER TRIENNIVM COMES,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">ib. 1140</span></i>
			.</div>
